### JWT claims shape

```json
{
  "sub": "...",
  "iss": "...",
  "email": "...",
  "exp": 1234567890
}
```

### Persistence model

- env `{{.Upper}}_ACCESS_TOKEN` → in-memory overlay, **stripped before writing** (envSourced flag).
- env `{{.Upper}}_COOKIEJAR` → path read on each invocation, cookies loaded into the client jar, **never copied into `session.json`** (envSourced flag, same pattern).
- `login --token` → persisted to `~/.{{.Name}}/session.json` (0600).
- `login --cookies cookies.json` → cookies parsed and persisted to `~/.{{.Name}}/session.json` (0600); source file can be deleted afterwards.
- `login --start --code` → flow-issued token persisted same way.

